.el .ds Aq '
.TH status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
status \- Show what push and pull would do, per session
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstatus\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show what `agr sync push` and `agr sync pull` would do.
.PP
Read only, never prompts. Needs the network to list the remote sessions.
.PP
EXAMPLE:
    agr sync status
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
